WEBVTT

00:21:28.204 --> 00:21:31.579
They found that banks were more likely to
de-escalate their commitment to problem

00:21:31.579 --> 00:21:33.746
loans after senior executives left.

00:21:34.371 --> 00:21:35.704
The executives who had approved

00:21:35.704 --> 00:21:39.121
the original loans were motivated to
keep justifying their decisions.

00:21:39.663 --> 00:21:41.038
When new executives took over,

00:21:41.246 --> 00:21:45.746
they quickly recognized that someone who's
missed 17 payments probably isn't

00:21:45.746 --> 00:21:47.371
going to come through a number 18

00:21:47.704 --> 00:21:54.579
if you move the loan decision from
the original people who made

00:21:54.579 --> 00:21:58.454
the loan just like going to
an objective third party,

00:21:58.621 --> 00:22:02.413
it's more likely that you will start
to recognize the losses.